@{
ViewData["Title"] = "A Letter For You";
}

<div class="page-navigation">
    <a asp-controller="BD" asp-action="Countdown" class="next-page-btn">
        <span>Next</span>
        <span class="next-arrow">→</span>
    </a>
</div>

<section class="journey-section letter-section">


<div class="page-heading">
    <p class="eyebrow">Chapter 05 — Just for You</p>

    <h1 class="section-title">A Letter From My Heart</h1>

    <p>
        Some feelings are too special to be left unsaid,
        so I chose to write them from my heart.
    </p>
</div>

<div class="envelope-wrap">
    <button class="envelope"
            id="openLetter"
            type="button"
            aria-expanded="false">

        <span class="envelope-flap">💌</span>
        <span>Open My Letter</span>

    </button>
</div>

<article class="love-letter" id="loveLetter" hidden>

    <p class="letter-greeting">
        Dear My Special Person,
    </p>

 

    <p>
        Thank you for every smile, every conversation, every laugh,
        and every little moment that slowly became a beautiful memory.
        You have a wonderful way of making ordinary days feel brighter
        without even realizing it.
    </p>

    <p>
        Your presence brings warmth, happiness, and something special
        that is difficult to describe but impossible not to feel.
        I genuinely appreciate every moment we share.
    </p>

    <p>
        On your birthday, my wish for you is simple — may your life be
        filled with endless happiness, beautiful memories, success,
        and all the love you truly deserve.
    </p>

    <p>
        Keep smiling, keep dreaming, and never forget how special you
        are. I hope this little journey I created for you reminds you
        of just how much you are appreciated.
    </p>

    <p>
        Thank you for being you. ❤️
    </p>

    <p class="letter-signoff">
        With all my love,<br />
        Always yours.
    </p>

</article>


</section>
